<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>10th Brygada</title>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Inter" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
        <!-- fontawesome link -->
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css">
    </head>
    <body>
        <!-- Header section -->
        <section class="header glass">
            <div class="logo">10th Brygada info.</div>
        </section>

        <section class="services">
            <h4 class="heading">Our <span>Services</span></h4>
            <div class="box-container">
                <div class="box glass">
                    <span>01</span>
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-react"></i>
                    <h3>React aplications</h3>
                    <p>We build progressive applications that attract attention and compel users to buy our product</p>
                </div>
                <div class="box glass">
                    <span>02</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i>
                    <h3>Express.js Back end</h3>
                    <p>If you want a high-quality designed back-end for your application - contact us!</p>
                </div>
                <div class="box glass">
                    <span>03</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-desktop"></i>
                    <h3>Desktop aplications</h3>
                    <p>We build extremely powerful desktop applications using WPF</p>
                </div>
                <div class="box glass">
                    <span>04</span>
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-flutter"></i>
                    <h3>Flutter apps</h3>
                    <p>Flutter transforms the entire app development process. Build, test, and deploy beautiful apps</p>
                </div>
                <div class="box glass">
                    <span>05</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i>
                    <h3>DataBase ERD</h3>
                    <p>Have problem with database modeling? Our team can help you!</p>
                </div>
                <div class="box glass">
                    <span>06</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-ruler"></i>
                    <h3>UX/UI design</h3>
                    <p>Don't have any idea what your app will look like? Our designers will always find a solution!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="footer">
            <a href="/about" class="footer-head">Find more <span>about</span> us</a>
        </section>

        <!-- active background -->
        <div class="blob-outer-container">
            <div class="blob-inner-container">
                <div class="blob"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </body>
</html>